Let $\mathbf{a}^*$ be a sink point of $H$. From \cref{lem:sinkdistance}, we can take a constant $K>0$ satisfying $K\epsilon \leq \inf\{\|H(\mathbf{x})-\mathbf{y}\|_\infty:\,\mathbf{x}\in B(\mathbf{a}^*,\epsilon),\mathbf{y}
